We had $169.7 million of cash and cash equivalents and $0.9 million of short-term investments as of June 30, 2026.

We expect to continue to incur significant expenses and increasing operating losses for the foreseeable future. Our net losses may fluctuate significantly from period to period, depending on the timing of our planned clinical trials and expenditures on other research and development activities. We expect our expenses will increase over time as we:

